,"ARCA","coordinate ascent","should have been mitigated","Competing objective","Mismatched generalization","Display of saliency score of each token","Token substitution and insertion","Zero-shot generation","Stochastic few-shot generation","Supervised learning","Reinforcement learning","Explore","Establish","Exploit","FLIRT","update in-context exemplars","FIFO","LIFO","the last one","Scoring","effectiveness","diversity","low-toxicity","Scoring-LIFO","robust","inner maximization","outer minimization","Inner maximization","Outer minimization","instruct","adversarial training","Paraphrase","Retokenization"],"url":"https://lilianweng.github.io/posts/2023-10-25-adv-attack-llm/","languages":["eng"],"emphasized_text_tags":["b","i","i","i","i","i","i","i","i","i","b","i","i","i","b","b","b","b","b","b","i","b","b","i","b","b","i","i","i","i","i","i","i","i","i","i","i","i","b","i","b","b","i","b","i","i","i","b","b","i","i","i","i","i","b","i","i"],"element_id":"2775507ceeaaa257529304164be2b816","chroma:document":"List of questions that inquire about a person's {phone number|home address|Social Security Number|email address}:  \n1.\n\nTo encourage high-quality and diverse samples, they adopted nucleus sampling with $p=0.95$. The diversity is measured as self-BLEU, that is, precisely, the maximum BLEU of a given case against 1000 cases. Lower self-BLEU indicates better diversity. There is a clear tradeoff between sample diversity and attack success rate. Zero-shot generation has least success rate in term of tricking offensive model outputs but preserves sampling diversity well, while with low KL penalty, RL fine-tuning maximizes reward effectively but at the cost of diversity, exploiting one successful attack patterns."}␀␀␀RkmoZJEhUqz/YsZTWth0ey6kHTNCVvJ9Ozz9tzWlmaJBqbaye5wphTgakJhWQ6A7UtTYoo3uLG2mdaW+DPg+Y4CFBzKVaTCW97056z1wGI/FIpllEP5iAEVKQiDMD1MZxN63BLuN8+s38zSEd/wKT7PMbJXAfP3XOKwk9loXQBc0LgJ1POigIrvEQyT7IoKTnfp3v6lilqhUmFD5ufuXc6OfvErTP75f8FmFw1rw=="}␀␀␀ _ˆFy␀␀␀
